## Overview
Tournaments module for competitive events. Rooms can host time-limited tournaments where users compete on leaderboard metrics (tips, messages, XP earned) with prize pools distributed via Stellar.

## Endpoints
| Method | Path | Description |
|--------|------|-------------|
| POST   | `/tournaments` | Create tournament |
| GET    | `/tournaments` | List active tournaments |
| GET    | `/tournaments/:id` | Tournament details |
| POST   | `/tournaments/:id/join` | Join tournament |
| GET    | `/tournaments/:id/leaderboard` | Live leaderboard |
| POST   | `/admin/tournaments/:id/end` | End tournament and distribute prizes |

## Data Models
```typescript
@Entity()
class Tournament {
  @PrimaryGeneratedColumn('uuid') id: string;
  @Column() name: string;
  @Column() roomId: string;
  @Column() metric: 'xp' | 'tips_sent' | 'messages';
  @Column('decimal') prizePoolXlm: number;
  @Column({ type: 'jsonb' }) prizeDistribution: { rank: number; percentage: number }[];
  @Column() startsAt: Date;
  @Column() endsAt: Date;
  @Column() status: 'upcoming' | 'active' | 'ended';
}
```

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] Prize pool funded by entry fees or tournament sponsor
- [ ] Prizes distributed via Stellar on tournament end
- [ ] Leaderboard updates in real-time
- [ ] Ties broken by earliest achievement time
- [ ] Tournament badge awarded to top 3 finishers

