## Complete Prize Boost System - Full Source Code

Here's **everything you need** to implement the full Prize Boost system. Copy-paste ready for your Next.js + Prisma + Stripe stack.

***

## 1. **Prisma Schema** (`prisma/schema.prisma`)

```prisma
model Photo {
  // ... your existing fields
  prizeBoost     Float         @default(0)
  boostCount     Int           @default(0)
  boosters       PrizeBoost[]
  charityName    String?
}

model PrizeBoost {
  id              String   @id @default(cuid())
  photoId         String
  boosterId       String?  
  amount          Float    
  charityAmount   Float    
  platformFee     Float    
  charityName     String?
  stripeSessionId String   @unique
  createdAt       DateTime @default(now())

  photo           Photo    @relation(fields: [photoId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  booster         User?    @relation(fields: [boosterId], references: [id], onDelete: SetNull)

  @@index([photoId])
  @@index([boosterId])
  @@index([createdAt])
}

model User {
  // ... existing fields
  prizeBoosts    PrizeBoost[]
}
```

**Run migration:**
```bash
npx prisma db push
npx prisma generate
```

